column102:
13/Apr/10 7:30 AM;557058:8eb04462-c6aa-4b1b-b7b4-259ed44d3c0b;r2515:

Posting an admin post should save the admin_id with the post (not retroactive);
Admin posts now have commentable_owners;
Admins should not have to fill in name and email when commenting / replying to comments.
Admins should now receive comment notifications for their posts - alas, this includes
their own comments - new issue to be opened.- **Status changed**: `FixedAndCommitted`

